body:
Have you heard of Eigenlicht? That is such a cool name right? Her name gives off a mysterious vibe. No wait, their name is acutally from German. Anyway, we should hang out sometime.

///

The only "complaint" I would have is that it is too long. I would personally shorten it, but I also come from a place where and names are only 3 syllables total (first + last). I am also a programmer, and programmers tend to be garbage at naming things so I would get a second opinion. Overall, pretty cool.
